---
---

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/images/Group-94.jpg" alt="" loading="eager" />
    <div class="hero__bg-fade"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container hero__grid">
    <div class="hero__content">
      <h1 id="hero-title">DaisyWoont reviews</h1>
      <p>
        Bij DaisyWoont word jij op je wenken bediend, met de beste producten op het gebied van wonen.
        Wij schrijven regelmatig reviews over woonartikelen die we uitproberen en geven je zo een eerlijk
        beeld over welke producten de moeite waard zijn om toe te voegen aan je meubilair!
      </p>
      <a href="/blogs/" class="btn btn-primary">Bekijk onze blogs</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__image">
      <img
        src="/images/hero-woman-thinking.png"
        alt="Interieurontwerper denkt na over nieuwe wooncollectie"
        width="517"
        height="727"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    isolation: isolate;
    min-height: clamp(420px, 62vw, 560px);
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .hero__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .hero__bg img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .hero__bg-fade {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72) 38%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) 62%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12) 100%
    );
  }

  .hero__grid {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: end;
    min-height: inherit;
  }

  .hero__content {
    padding-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease forwards;
  }

  .hero__content h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .hero__content p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: #444;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero__image {
    display: none;
    justify-self: end;
    align-self: end;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    line-height: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s 0.15s ease both;
  }

  .hero__image img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: min(560px, 78vh);
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: bottom center;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 18px 28px rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.16));
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .hero__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
      align-items: end;
    }

    .hero__image {
      display: block;
      margin-inline: 0 0;
      max-width: none;
      /* Sit the portrait on the bottom edge (red mark) */
      margin-bottom: 0;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .hero__image img {
      max-height: min(580px, 85%);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .hero__image {
      width: min(100%, 520px);
      justify-self: end;
    }
  }

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
